        },
        {
          "text": "Soni ŵakulocesya wosope ŵele ŵaŵaŵecete kutandila Samuele, mpaka wosope ŵele ŵiŵayice panyuma pakwe nombe nawo, ŵalalicilaga ya masiku agano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
