          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja mli ŵanace ŵa jwakulocesya mcilanga ciŵaŵisile Mlungu kwa acinangolo ŵenu. Paja ŵasalile Abulahamu kuti, ‘Mwa cisukulu cenu tinjapa upile ŵandu wosope ŵa pa cilambo capasi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
